  "change": [],
  "remove": [],
  "adopts": [],
  "note": "HR supplies contractual fixed-and-regular gross before DTP, including natura, while first_month is January for existing employees or the first employment month in 2025; dtp_utilization_report_date is the per-period ISO date of an effective original or amended utilization report. Existing rules already exclude DTP from taxable gross and credit it in net/gross-up payroll, so the added cash-pay rule addresses employer-borne payroll without double counting, and a scheme-specific amount isolates this stimulus's nonrefundable annual excess."
}

